y: </span><br>A two min update, including an excerpt from the initial story, press conference by Min Lindiwe Sisulu and an interview with Dr Jenifer Fitchett. <br><br><span class=\"headin\">Expert:</span><br><a href=\"expert/74197\">Dr. Jeniffer  Fitchett Scientist</a><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Locations:</span><br>Johannesburg<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\">Status:</span> <span class=\"app\">Approved</span><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Proposal Date:</span> Friday, 01 November 2019<br><span class=\"headin\">Approved By:</span> Chwayitisa Futshane<br><span class=\"headin\">Approval Date:</span> 01 November 2019<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Commission</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\"><span class=\"headin\">Commission Number:</span> 5574<br><span class=\"headin\">Duration:</span> 2<br><span class=\"headin\">Delivery Date:</span> Sunday, 03 November 2019<br><span class=\"headin\">Accept Contract:</span> I agree with the following <a href=\"cap-contractual-agreement/74198\">CAP Contractual Agreement</a><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal Viewing:</span> No<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted By:</span> Siniketiwe Hlanze<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted Date:</span> 01 November 2019<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pan