                  <th scope=\"col\">Duration</th>\n                                                            <th scope=\"col\">Publisher</th>\n                                                            <th scope=\"col\">Composer</th>\n                                                            <th scope=\"col\">Record/CD Number</th>\n                                                            </tr>\n                                                            </thead>\n                                                            <tbody><tr class=\"table-primary\">\n                                                                <td>Shocking Truth</td>\n                                                                <td>Instrumental</td>\n                                                                <td>7</td>\n                                                                <td>00:00:08</td>\n                                                                <td>Audio Network Limited</td>\n                                                                <td>Terry Devine King</td>\n                                                                <td>1879</td>\n                                                                </tr><tr class=\"table-secondary\">\n                                                                <td>Gut feelings</td>\n                                                                <td>Instrumental</td>\n                                                                <td></td>\n                                                                <td>00:00:00</td>\n                                                                <td></td>\n                                                                <td></td>\n                                                                <td></td>\n                                                                </tr><tr class=\"table-primary\">\n                                                                <td>Progressitivity Main</td>\n                                                                <td>Instrumental</td>\n                                                                <td>17</td>\n                                                                <td>00:00:22</td>\n                                                                <td>Videohelper</td>\n                                                                <td>Joseph M Saba, Stewart J Winter</td>\n                                                                <td>VH420</td>\n                                                                </tr><tr class=\"table-secondary\">\n                                                                <td>Aqualands</td>\n                                                                <td>Instrumental</td>\n                                                                <td>21</td>\n                                                                <td>00:00:08</td>\n                                                                <td>KPM Music</td>\n                                                                <td>John Christopher Lemke</td>\n                                                                <td>KPM752</td>\n                                                                </tr></tbody>\n                                                            </table></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><h3>TX Details</h3><br><h4>Back references from Insert in Show:</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"table table-hover table-responsive\" id=\"backref-tbl\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Title</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Author</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Last Updated</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr class=\"table-primary\"><td><a href=\"show-view/74184\">03 November 2019 - Carte Blanche HD</a></td><td><a href=\"user-view/142\">mihle@combinedartists.co.za</a></td><td data-sort=\"\">02 December 2019</td></tr></tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table><h4>Script:</h4><br>Dr Jenifer Fitchet – senior lecturer at Wits University warns that this dry spell may have devastating effects for the agricultural sector\t<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n06:03 – 06:27 Jen: in terms of the implications of the longer dry period it’s particularly difficult for the agricultural sector because we’ve got prime period for sowing crops, we’ve got our prime flowering period, we see a lot pollination taking place in our spring months and if those spring months aren’t coupled with wetter conditions we’re gonna see a lot of losses in terms of our produce that we’re gonna get.\t<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nDrought Onlined<br>\n00:32 – 00:36<br>\n00:54-01:05<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nWhilst parts of Gauteng have received some rain, Fitchett explains the delay in rainy season \t<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nJen “we’re seeing this very dominant high pressure system over the interior and that high pressure system is prohibiting any significant cloud development and is preventing us from having that atmospheric instability that we need to be able to get a rain event”<br>\n\t<br>\nIn the meantime officials and experts alike are appealing to us to use water wisely and sparingly\t<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n07:34 – 07:48 Jen: for individuals in their houses it’s things we’ve heard of the years. So switching off your tap when you’re brushing your teeth, making sure that you don’t’ have any leaks in the plumbing inside your house and if you do have leaks trying to collect that water and using it sensibly<br>\n<br>\n07:57 – 08:02 during water restrictions there are limits on when you’re supposed to water your garden \t<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nSunday Story<br>\n09:14 – 