ushing your teeth, making sure that you don’t’ have any leaks in the plumbing inside your house and if you do have leaks trying to collect that water and using it sensibly 07:57 – 08:02 during water restrictions there are limits on when you’re supposed to water your garden Sunday Story 09:14 – 09:20 Drought Onlined 01:42 – 01:48 Sunday Story 03;10",
